================================================================================
SOURCES DELIBERATELY NOT USED
================================================================================

The European Chemicals Agency (ECHA) publishes a convenience spreadsheet of
CLP Annex VI Table 3. The distributed registry does NOT use, redistribute, or
derive from it. ECHA's download page states the table "should not be used for
commercial activities or reproduced further", and ECHA's legal notice
prohibits both the replication of substantial parts of its databases and
systematic automated collection from its website. ECHA additionally asserts
that CAS numbers on its site are the property of the American Chemical Society.

Annex VI data in this module is instead derived from the consolidated text of
Regulation (EC) No 1272/2008 published on EUR-Lex, which the European
Commission makes available for commercial and non-commercial reuse under
Commission Decision 2011/833/EU and licenses under CC BY 4.0.

The optional `annexvi-crosscheck` command reads a copy supplied locally by an
authorised user, compares it in memory, and prints counts. It performs no ECHA
download and writes or publishes no ECHA-derived artifact.

